Subject: [PATCH 2/2] web/: re-port at the 405-row matrix, with the tip-and-cue
 scenarios in the Studio

The site rebuilt and re-ported with the matrix at 405 rows (176 VALIDATED, 225 MODELLED, 4 PARTNER):
the Home stat strip, the Evidence ledger heading, provenance line and domain bars, Editions, the
capability reference (ephem_export now has its row). The social card (og-card.svg, .png) regenerated
by tools/gen_og_card.py. The Studio library gains tip-and-cue-short and tip-and-cue-baltic-m2
(spaceops), recorded natively and in the browser build, with a plain-language summary for the
tip-and-cue kind, and their pages link them in the Studio. The site's recorders re-run at the
previous commit; the Studio's verification-matrix.json copied from web/data.

i18n: studio-js.ftl regenerated (seven new Studio strings); the pages re-extracted, translations
renumbered and migrated; the three Evidence domain lines whose totals moved (of 104, 79 and 56
validated) carried in all 17 languages with the new number.
