shana_<wbr>gnss_<wbr>lib_<wbr>py.py</code></summary><dl class="lg-body"><dt>Capability</dt><dd>A ROS-free bridge that writes fix and satellite messages as NMEA and scores them through the Python binding (integrations/ros2/kshana_trust), and a gnss_lib_py NavData to receiver-trust bridge through the rtklib-pos format (integrations/gnss_lib_py).</dd><dt>Oracle</dt><dd>None external: the ROS node was not run on a live ROS 2 graph, and the ublox_ubx_msgs field names were not checked against a running driver. gnss_lib_py (MIT) was run for the bridge test</dd><dt>Tests</dt><dd><code>tests/receiver_trust_machines.rs (rtklib_pos_runs_as_a_receiver_log: the format the gnss_lib_py bridge writes, run through receiver-trust); the Python tests of the bridges are…</code></dd></dl></details></div><p class="fl-empty" data-fl-empty hidden>Nothing matches that filter.</p></div><p class="lgx-foot">Generated from the engine's verification matrix and pinned by a test. Scroll the list, or open a row for its capability, oracle and tests. The full table, every column at once, is in the docs: <a href="/docs/capability-reference#matrix">Capability reference</a>.</p></div></div>
