l design -&gt; pass link budget -&gt;</li><li><a href="/studio/?scenario=leo-pnt-mega-shell&amp;tab=coverage&amp;play=1">leo-pnt-mega-shell</a>: A low-Earth-orbit positioning, navigation and timing (PNT) mega-constellation: 5 000</li><li><a href="/studio/?scenario=leo-ppp-convergence&amp;tab=leo-positioning">leo-ppp-convergence</a>: Precise point positioning (PPP) convergence with LEO augmentation.</li><li><a href="/studio/?scenario=leo-pvt-fjord-skyline&amp;tab=leo-positioning">leo-pvt-fjord-skyline</a>: Fused MEO and LEO positioning for a vessel deep in a fjord, where the valley walls hide</li><li><a href="/studio/?scenario=leo-resilience-gnss-jammed-leo-carries&amp;tab=campaign&amp;play=1">leo-resilience-gnss-jammed-leo-carries</a>: LEO-PNT resilience mission: GNSS jammed, LEO-PNT carries the user, integrity maintained.</li><li><a href="/studio/?scenario=leo-resilience-js-margin&amp;tab=spectrum&amp;play=1">leo-resilience-js-margin</a>: LEO-PNT resilience from received power: the jammer-to-signal (J/S) margin.</li><li><a href="/studio/?scenario=leo-resilience-multiband-diversity&amp;tab=campaign">leo-resilience-multiband-diversity</a>: LEO-PNT resilience by band diversity: one jammer, a four-band receiver.</li><li><a href="/studio/?scenario=leo-resilience-spoof-doppler&amp;tab=leo-pass">leo-resilience-spoof-doppler</a>: LEO-PNT resilience against spoofing: Doppler and pass-geometry consistency.</li><li><a href="/studio/?scenario=leo-resilience-spoof-monitors&amp;tab=campaign">leo-resilience-spoof-monitors</a>: LEO-PNT resilience against spoofing: which monitor sees which spoofer.</li><li><a href="/studio/?scenario=leo-timing-utc&amp;tab=leo-positioning">leo-timing-utc</a>: Time transfer to UTC from LEO satellites, against C/N0 and the receiver oscillator.</li><li><a href="/studio/?scenario=leo-vertical-5g-network-timing&amp;tab=campaign&amp;play=1">leo-vertical-5g-network-timing</a>: LEO-PNT vertical: wireless networks, 5G/6G base-station timing.</li><li><a href=